<title>RUSSIA: St Petersburg has not yet registered Eurobond.</title>
<headline>St Petersburg has not yet registered Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Finance Ministry has not yet registered the City of St Petersburg Eurobond prospectus, a senior ministry official said on Friday.</p>
<p>Head of securities department Bella Zlatkis told Reuters the issue may be registered on Monday, if city officials were ready with all the documents.</p>
<p>St Petersburg plans to issue up to $300 million in a two to five year Eurobond through Salomon Bros.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
